ch_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">732125dd-782a-4396-8b4c-be95cfee1ebe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:732125dd-782a-4396-8b4c-be95cfee1ebe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:732125dd-782a-4396-8b4c-be95cfee1ebe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tusgront\" title=\"Tusgront\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Tusgront.png/25px-Portrait_Tusgront.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Tusgront.png/38px-Portrait_Tusgront.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Tusgront.png/50px-Portrait_Tusgront.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tusgront\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Tusgront.png/25px-Portrait_Tusgront.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Portrait_Tusgront.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tusgront\" title=\"Tusgront\">Tusgront</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Lads,\n</p><p><br>\nNo joke anymore. <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nine-Fingers\">Nine-Fingers</a> wants the entrance locked down until this <a href=\"/wiki/Stone_Lord\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stone Lord\">Stone Lord</a> business is done - customers and 'friends' of yours be damned. We didn't close during the dock riots. We didn't close for the Steeps Strangler. So get it through your heads - this is serious.\n</p><p><br>\nSomeone read this to Tusgront.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1538/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24767/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5842/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936157/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.474      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.474      1 -total\n 53.86%   23.953      6 Template:Icon_text\n 48.97%   21.779     15 Template:Trim\n 28.07%   12.486      2 Template:Uid\n 16.09%    7.155      2 Template:Template_style\n 14.51%    6.454      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.85%    6.159      2 Template:Icon_link\n  9.86%    4.387      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.48%    4.217      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35820-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215429 and revision id 365595. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}